%SIXMD 1
# @?ECHO - PRINT ARGUMENTS

## @?OPERANDS

### @?[ARG ...]
ZERO OR MORE ARGUMENTS TO WRITE, SEPARATED BY ONE SPACE.

## DESCRIPTION

ECHO WRITES ITS ARGUMENTS TO STANDARD OUTPUT FOLLOWED BY A NEWLINE.
USAGE IS 'ECHO [ARG ...]'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
